    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> Displaying its predatory skills when it comes to bringing down fleeing prey, your foe savages the back of your ankle, damaging the large Achilles tendon.</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> You gain @Condition[Prone] and the leg is useless for the rest of the encounter (see under Amputated Parts). Afterwards it’ll count as Torn Muscle (Major).</p>"
